# C: ES auto-tuned PID: the best gains of the in-flight CMA-ES (livetune) flights, rate loops from lab_d_livetune_rate
# (idx 9-14) and xy position from lab_d_livetune_pos (idx 24-35), written on the ground first, stop-and-wait (RAM: a
# reboot loses them). Same track as lab_c_robust (hand/sim C3 tune), lab_c_lqr and lab_c_mpc: the 4-way comparison.
# Fly it: fly lab_c_autotune --once at >= 15.8 V resting. Plan: docs/lab/run-sheet-2026-10-16.md
campaign lab-c-autotune
rate 100
log velocity_loops camera_fusion
set g_xy_ctrl_kind=0 g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=10
takeoff 0.5
hold 3
goto x=0.4 y=0 z=0.5 dwell_s=4
hold 4
set traj_p.move_s=12 traj_p.hold_s=1
preset circle circ_r_cm=30
hold 2
preset figure8 f8_a_cm=30
hold 3
land
